# Store and check out every text file with LF, as .editorconfig asks. Without this,
# Git on Windows (core.autocrlf) writes CRLF into the working copy and warns on every
# add. Images and PDFs are binary: say so rather than rely on detection.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
